The entrance exam will be held online on March 3, 2021. Subjects to be tested include: Mathematics, Physics and Chemistry. To take the exam at this institute, candidates must have a high school diploma or equivalent.
Techo Sen Institute of Public Works and Transport, established by the Ministry of Public Works and Transport, is another new achievement for the Royal Government of Cambodia, led by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, in developing human resources on the skills of building roads, bridges and ports.
The Ministry of Public Works and Transport, in collaboration with the Institute of Technology of Cambodia (ITC), trains students to ensure the quality and effectiveness of education. In addition, the institute has gathered professional professors to train and equip modern technology systems to provide knowledge to students. The institute has established equipment, laboratories and laboratories in the field of bridges and roads to provide better understanding to students.
