(Phnom Penh): Techo Sen Russey Trup Fresh Milk is ready to be included in the product list "One Village, One Product". This is according to the press release of the meeting on the cooperation between the National Committee for the Promotion of One Village, One Product Movement and the Royal Academy of Cambodia on Techo Sen Russey Trip Fresh Dairy to be included in the list of One Village One Product that the media Received Fresh News on February 16, 2021.
