Please be informed that Khmer fresh milk is the result of the research and overcoming many obstacles of the Royal Academy of Cambodia distributed in the market during October 2019. Currently, this fresh milk is being distributed in some supermarkets in Phnom Penh, and there is also delivery of orders and distribution to the provinces.
