The Royal Academy of Cambodia Techo Sen Russey Trip Park in Preah Vihear province's Chep district was discovered as Cambodia's largest steel industry site 1,000 years ago. In modern times, this area has also been transformed into a food industry in Cambodia in order to improve the lives of the people. Those who have consumed fresh milk, Khmer products, praised the taste as more delicious than some fresh milk imported from neighboring countries.
