Ky Tech Lawyer: Only Cambodian Leaders Spend Their Own Budget to Establish a Free Civil Defense Lawyer Group (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Through personal research, Ky Tech Lawyer, President of Samdech Techo Sen He said that in this world, only Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the head of the Royal Government of Cambodia, spends his own money to set up a group of volunteer lawyers to defend the rights of the people free of charge.
Mr. Ky Tech said this at the signing ceremony of the Memorandum of Understanding on Cooperation between Samdech Techo Sen Volunteer Lawyers and the Senate Complaints and Investigation Commission (First Committee) on February 15. 2021 Presided over by His Excellency Dr. Tep Ngon, Second Vice President of the Senate.
According to Ky Tech, all law firms have to take fees from clients to run their institutions. For Samdech Techo Sen Volunteer Lawyers is to protect the people, especially women victims free of charge because all expenses are paid directly by Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Samdech Kittipritthbandit, ie Samdech Techo Volunteer Lawyers Sen does not use the state budget.
The fact that Samdech Techo Hun Sen spent money to set up such a group of volunteer lawyers, and only then did Mr. Kitech find out that no other leader of the country has sacrificed like Samdech Techo Hun Sen. He also considered that the activities of Samdech Techo Hun Sen are invaluable and this is something that happened with the clear and correct thinking of Samdech Techo.
"According to my research, Cambodians are very lucky to have a leader who is willing to donate money to help the people," he said. According to the research, no country has a prime minister who spends his own money to set up a group of lawyers to help the people. The thinking of Samdech Techo and Samdech Kat Prith Bundith is very valuable for our Cambodian people.
Currently, Samdech Techo Sen has a total of 137 volunteer lawyers and is present in all provincial capitals of Cambodia. According to Mr. Kitech, he added that the composition of Samdech Techo Sen's volunteer lawyers is sufficient to defend the current defense, but he expects to increase the situation after the memorandum of understanding with the First Commission. The Senate to facilitate more and faster people.
