The following is the decision of Samdech Techo Hun Sen: Commander of Kampong Thom Military Operation Area: Veterans sacrifice their fresh flesh and blood to contribute to the peace of the country.
(Kampong Thom): Major General Som Sun, Commander of the Kampong Thom Military Operations Area and President of the Kampong Thom Veterans Association of Kampong Thom, stated that Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Samdech Kittipritthbandit have always cared for veterans because veterans are Those who sacrificed fresh flesh and blood to participate in making the country as peaceful as it is today.
