(Phnom Penh): For the first time, 1,000 educational books on 19 cases of Kovid in Chinese were released and given to Cambodian children at the same time as the Kovid-19 vaccination of the Royal Government of Cambodia on the 10th. This February 2021.
This educational book in Khmer language is published by a Chinese company called CHINA Hortan (CHD) with the aim of educating and educating children about the prevention of HIV / AIDS by using good hygiene, wearing a mask and washing hands. With soap, keeping a social distance and showing symptoms of this vicious infection, such as high fever, chest tightness, shortness of breath.
