The student representatives of Chung Jing School expressed their pleasure by reading comic books and watching all kinds of video clips about the experiments of the computer "illuminating the future" on the computer during the outbreak of infectious diseases. He hopes the book will provide more knowledge on disease prevention for 5- to 16-year-olds to better understand and support local education. Full.
