"This is an award for journalists, not an award for outstanding journalists." This is the original idea and the core idea in organizing this "Gratitude Award". The "Gratitude Award" was organized with the aim of "thanking" individuals who have contributed to the development and improvement of the media in Cambodia from 1970 to the 2010s.
The journalists to be selected are Cambodian journalists who work for news companies in Cambodia (Cambodian journalists work for Khmer news companies better). Selection must be made without regard to political affiliation.
Please note that this selection is based on study history, work experience, work experience and knowledge sharing in training courses or in the field of journalism.
