* Violation of the principle of peaceful transfer of power
* Ineligible to be president
Donald Trump's actions to alter the election results and accuse him of rigging the election make it clear that he does not deserve to be president. He refused to recognize the election results until January 2021, when he agreed to hand over power to Joe Biden.
