Al-Amal's success now makes the United Arab Emirates the fifth country in the world to have a plane in orbit around Mars, marking the 50th anniversary of the unification of the United Arab Emirates. Also. TOP NEWS: Lt. Gen. Hun Manet, Samdech Techo's eldest son, vaccinated 19 first Kovid at Calmette Hospital
