Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng Instructs Authorities to Resolve Conflicts and Protests Peacefully Based on Legal Principles
(Phnom Penh): Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Interior, instructed all levels of authorities, especially local officials, to take care to resolve disputes and demands peacefully based on legal principles and to absolutely avoid Violence in all its forms.
Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng made this instruction on February 9, 2021, on the occasion that Samdech presided over the announcement of the position of Chairman of the Secretariat, Deputy Chairman and Assistant to the Disaster Management Secretariat of the Ministry of Interior. Surface.
