(Phnom Penh): Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Interior, on February 9, 2021, presided over the inauguration ceremony as the Chairman of the Secretariat, Deputy Chairman and Assistant to the Disaster Management Secretariat of the Ministry of Interior. .
The inauguration ceremony was held at the Ministry of Interior with the participation of many leaders of the Ministry of Interior.
He stated that Samdech Krala Hos Kheng has decided to change the composition of the Secretariat for Disaster Management, with Dr. Seang Bun Chheang, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Interior as the Chairman of the Disaster Management Secretariat, as well as its Deputy Chairman and 21 members.
Please be informed that the Disaster Management Secretariat of the Ministry of Interior is under the direct leadership of Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, whose main duties are:
* First: Develop a strategic plan, action plan, preparedness, prevention and disaster response activities, both prenatal and postnatal.
* Second, cooperate with other competent forces to carry out emergency search operations to protect the lives of the victims, maintain peace and social order at the request of the National Committee for Disaster Management.
* Third: Coordinate and cooperate with the National Committee for Disaster Management, Ministries, Institutions, Development Partners, Private Sector in launching and implementing urgent measures to find and rescue for disasters that have been occurring.
* Fourth: Develop a financial reserve plan, means and materials necessary to respond in a timely manner to the search and rescue operations of the forces.
And 5: Perform other duties assigned by the National Committee for Disaster Management or the Minister of Interior.
