(Koh Kong): Mr. Thong Khon, Minister of Tourism, stated that all tourism trips to community-based tourism, ecotourism and rural tourism areas must use the services of the community absolutely can not skip communication with the community. That cooperation and good relations with the community will be able to contribute to improve the lives of local people better.
