Samdech Techo Hun Sen further advised that the Royal Government of Cambodia does not care about what a handful of people say, what the Royal Government needs to consider is the well-being of 16 million Cambodians in a country that needs to maintain peace. Political stability, socio-economic development, poverty reduction continue.
