Appointed Chairman of Preah Vihear Provincial Party Youth Working Group, Mr. Ouk Kimsan to replace Mr. Yong Kim Heang
(Preah Vihear): Mr. Prak Sovann, Member of the Central Committee of the Cambodian People's Party and Chairman of the Preah Vihear Provincial Party Committee, on February 7, 2021, presided over the handover ceremony of the Chairman of the Provincial Party Youth Working Group. Ouk Kimsan was appointed to replace Yong Kim Heang.
The newly appointed Mr. Ouk Kimsan expressed his commitment as follows:
* Strive and pay attention to serve the people and lead to fulfill the duties for the motherland and the people.
* Continue to raise the patriotic flag with all the physical and mental strength and ability to actively participate in the implementation of political programs, principles, policies, decisions and guidelines of the Cambodian People's Party and the Provincial Party Committee.
* Continue to strive to expand the structure of the Party Youth at all levels by working closely with Party Committees and Party branches at all levels, and strive to re-establish Party members as youth in the system and outside the system in all forms and in all ways. In line with the principle of "keep the old, increase the new" and inspire the youth movement to support the right cause of the party.
