The ceremony was presided over by Mr. Chhay Thorn, Chairman of the Provincial Assistance Team, Mr. HUN Many, First Vice President, as well as the leaders of the Central Assistance Team and Kampong Speu Provincial Party, in the presence of the Commune Assistance Team. Sangkats and Chairmen of the 87 Commune / Sangkat Party Committees throughout Kampong Speu Province.
This meeting is a meeting of the party working group at both the central and local levels to listen to the report on the party's activities achieved in 2020 and the direction for 2021, as well as the promotion of support on priority work towards the commune council elections. / Sangkat 2022.
Drawing on the experience of the previous election, the working group has made it a priority to ensure the party's victory for the upcoming election, which must be adequately and fully prepared in advance.
