Mr. Sam Rithy, Representing the Strategic Group of the Provincial Working Group, emphasized the strengthening of party members in both quantity and quality, continue to increase the number of members everywhere to prepare for the Commune / Sangkat Council elections, especially to continue to visit members. Party to village level.
