Do not want to try drugs even half a time! Nationwide drug crackdown for February 6: 25 cases cracked, 60 arrested
(Phnom Penh): The nationwide campaign against illegal drugs for February 6, 2021 showed that law enforcement forces cracked down on 25 cases, including 10 cases of use and 15 cases of trafficking, arresting 60 suspects.
