The ASEAN-India Tourism Ministerial Meeting also evaluated and approved the work results of the implementation of the ASEAN-India Tourism Cooperation Action Plan in the past and approved the ASEAN-India Tourism Cooperation Action Plan 2021-2021, which focuses on strengthening cooperation. Better operation refers to the development of ASEAN-India tourism that is more sustainable, responsible and resilient.
