Road dispute between 37 families and the company splits the land after the people paid the company $ 7,500
(Phnom Penh): A road dispute between 37 families and a company splitting a plot of land where the owner of the company is a military officer who blocked the road to prevent people from traveling, cut off the water to use and sell the land purchased in exchange. And that $ 18,000 has been lingering for more than a year.
Finally, by the evening of February 5, 2021, the settlement was finalized after the 37 families raised $ 7,500 to pay the company owner to split the lot. Agreed to give the road more than 4 and a half meters wide and 14 meters long to the people to travel under the coordination of the authorities of Po Sen Chey district.
Both parties were invited to meet in the auditorium of Khan Por Senchey, Phnom Penh under the coordination of Mr. Preap Manel, Deputy Governor and Mr. Director of Land Office, Urban Planning, Construction, Cadastral Construction, Khan Por Sen Chey.
Sangkat and village authorities, as well as some relevant office officials, after resolving the case, the district authority of Po Sen Chey and arrange for the preparation of documents to separate the plots, make a solid plan for the people to occupy and use legally.
On that occasion, the people expressed their happiness and expressed their gratitude to the authorities of Po Sen Chey district for helping to solve the story and consider making a solid plan for them now.
Recall that 37 families were upset and filed a complaint to the authorities of Po Sen Chey district to ask for help, accusing the owner of a company to split a plot of land with his wife Chhoeun Sovannara and her husband Horn Heng military occupation. Deceived and blocked the road, more than 4 and a half meters wide and 14 meters long, not allowing them to use, demanding $ 18,000 to be able to use.
Not only that, they said that they bought the land from the owner of this company during 2014, when they decided to buy because the company claimed that its land location has the right water, electricity and transfer. .
After the purchase, the company transferred the rights to them in Choam Chao Sangkat with the signature of the Sangkat Chief, then they built a house to live forever. However, they wanted to sell, but the company forbade them to do so. Let some of them use it.
