The brutal incident like in the Hong Kong story happened on January 30, 2021 at 16:30 at Chunlong Mlou resort, Chong Beong village, Makak commune, Ang Snoul district, Kandal province.
According to the police inspector, on February 2, 2021, the specialized force in cooperation with Post Makak and Post Ponsaing police in Prek Pnov district arrested 2 suspects. The three suspects are:
* First name: Tith Tin, 18 years old, Occupation: Student in Ta Skor village, Sangkat Ponsaing, Khan Prek Pnov, Phnom Penh. . According to the suspect's confession, Tith Ponleu admitted that he and his accomplices actually acted on the victim, causing serious injuries.
Police told the story that before the incident, the victim went to sit on the pool in the resort Chlonglong Mlou in Chong Boeng village, Makak commune, Ang Snoul district with nine friends, including four girls.
The suspects and their accomplices then fled on motorcycles to the east and disappeared. The victim was taken by friends and family to the hospital in Phnom Penh.
