(Oddar Meanchey): Mr. Pen Kosal, Governor of Oddar Meanchey Province, on February 4, 2021, led the working group and the Armed Forces to inspect and set up a tent as a center for meditation in the provincial stadium to prepare to receive workers. Returning from Thailand.
