(Siem Reap): Lt. Gen. Hun Manet, Deputy Commander of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces, Commander of the Land Forces, urged and urged the people to unite and be ready to join the government in implementing health measures and receiving 19 Kovid vaccines at each stage. .
The above encouragement and request was made at the closing ceremony of the training course on logistics, military, ambulance and truck driving skills for the 4th Army Division and 2nd Intervention Division in Siem Reap Province on 4 February. 2021.
Lt. Gen. Hun Manet stated, "Let the people unite and be ready to join the government in implementing health measures and getting vaccinated at each stage according to the Royal Government's plan to protect ourselves, our families and our society." "We and our people are in this difficult situation."
