(Phnom Penh): His Majesty the King of Cambodia, His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni, sent a message to Mr. Nguyen Fu Chong congratulating him on his election as Secretary General of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of Vietnam. And President of the Socialist Republic of Vietnam in the new term.
In a message issued on February 1, 2021, the King of Cambodia said that he was pleased and congratulated Nguyen Fu Chong on the occasion of the General Assembly of the Communist Party of Vietnam. The 13th re-elected Secretary General of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of Vietnam for the 13th mandate on January 31, 2021.
His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni expressed his firm belief that under the wise leadership of General Secretary Nguyen Phu Trong, Vietnam will achieve great success, development and stability in all fields, stability, cooperation and cooperation. National development has been even better.
