In addition, Mr. Meas Nhim confirmed that for 2020, Preah Vihear provincial authorities have found 22 cases of illegal crimes and sent them to court, of which 10 cases have been convicted and are being prosecuted. Imprisoned for 1 to 5 years. In addition to the remaining 12 cases, the court is continuing legal proceedings.
