(Phnom Penh): Mr. Sok Chenda Sophea, Minister Delegate to the Prime Minister, Secretary General of the Council for the Development of Cambodia, said that the new investment law is simple in the administrative procedures, administrative procedures of investment applications and easy to understand and easy to apply to investors. In Cambodia.
The new investment law is expected to be launched in mid-2021, while the government is currently busy preparing.
Mr. Sok Chenda Sophea stated that "the preparation of the new investment law is made to be attractive Administrative procedures, administrative procedures for investment applications are very simple and reduce the time by "List with the Council for the Development of Cambodia and do not need to go to the tax and the Ministry of Commerce."
The Secretary General of the Council for the Development of Cambodia also stated that the new investment law aims to make investors see that applying for investment in Cambodia is easy.
Mr. Sok Chenda Sophea said, "The new investment law and the sub-decree to implement this new law, I believe that when going out, investors may not have the need to contact to explain to explain, it seems clear."
Mr. Sok Chenda Sophea said that the Council for the Development of Cambodia is a one-stop shop for investment decisions, but in practice it is not a one-stop shop. So we will do it through this new law to make it complete, to avoid wasting time waiting for a lot of paperwork.
He added that in the past, projects approved by the Council for the Development of Cambodia were tax-exempt for three to nine years, after which a 20 percent tax was levied, but after the new investment law was enacted, investors paid taxes. In the first year, only 25 percent of the 20 percent. For subsequent years will be paid in installments.
In addition, Mr. Sok Chenda Sophea said that the new investment law also provides incentives to investors who pay for human resource training, provision of transportation, modernization of production and provision. Health through restaurants, etc. At the same time, the new investment law will also have special incentives in each sector.
The minister said that the Kovid-19 era had created a major problem for the world in the economic field: uncertainty, which is a concern for the future.
At the same time, he also said that the Council for the Development of Cambodia has worked hard in its work, when investors come to invest and have agreed, the Council for the Development of Cambodia strives to provide services to investors to satisfy them. They expand their investment.
Please be informed that in 2020, Cambodia received a total of 238 investment projects with a total investment capital of more than 8,250 million US dollars, a decrease of 12% compared to the same period in 2019 with 315 investment projects of 9,397 million US dollars.
The decline was hailed by senior government officials in terms of investment attraction as a good sign, as the 19-crisis Kovid crisis sent global investment down 42 percent and Asean down 31 percent. . Chairman of the 10th Committee of the Senate Meets with Trapeang Veng Commune Council 61 Poor Families and Newly Born Women
