National Bank of Cambodia announces research and communication internship opportunities for 7 students
(Phnom Penh): The National Bank of Cambodia (NBC) has issued a notice to the public on the provision of research, research assistance and communication internship opportunities to seven researchers and students for 12 months at the Department of Economic Research and International Cooperation. National Bank of Cambodia.
