Arrests 11 More People to Defecate in Public Daun Penh for Education
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Sok Penh Vuth, Governor of Daun Penh District, assigned the Daun Penh District People's Defense Force to inspect and detain 11 more people who defecated in the trees, in the gardens, on the walls of people's houses, on the walls of construction sites and in public places. Which disrupts the order and causes a bad smell to travelers and affects the health of the general population.
After the inspection, the district force invited them to come to Daun Penh district hall for education and instructed them to spray and clean the place where they defecated before allowing them to return.
The district administration urges all citizens not to follow their example and to find the right place to defecate in a public or private bathroom near you, to avoid following them, causing anarchy, disorder, hygiene and harm. To public health as well.
According to the Daun Penh district administration, since the day of the operation, the authorities have detained 42 people and taken them to school.
