Secretary of State for the Ministry of Social Affairs Em Chanmakara continued that the National Strategic Plan on Disability focuses on poverty alleviation and the provision of quality and equitable health services, as well as rehabilitation, physical and mental health. Also considered a priority strategy.
Mr. Em Chanmakara said that the provision of justice, protection, discrimination, abuse, insult and exploitation of people with disabilities is the most attention from the head of the Royal Government of Cambodia, Samdech Akka Moha Sena Padei Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of God. Kingdom of Cambodia.
Separately, education at the national and sub-national levels is highly developed, Secretary of State Em Chanmakara said that so far, the gradation of schools at the sub-national level has been built by the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports to more than 2 Ten thousand slopes, which makes it easier for students with disabilities.
