Construction of new school building and infrastructure at Hun Sen Primary School and High School as a gift from Samdech Techo Hun Sen is under construction
(Pursat): Construction of new school building and other infrastructure at Hun Sen Pramoy Primary School and Hun Sen Pramoy High School, a gift from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, has been busy to meet the needs and Facilitate the study-accommodation of students and teachers in the area.
According to current estimates, the construction of Hun Sen Pramoy Primary School has completed 70% of the gates, 60% of the office and library, 50% of the three-story school building and 60% of the fence. At Hun Sen Pramoy High School, 10% of the gates, 70% of the offices and libraries, 70% of the three-story school buildings, 70% of the dormitories for students and teachers and 70% of the fences will be completed soon. Face.
Heng Sopheana, Governor of Veal Veng District, said this morning, February 1, 2021, that the construction of the new school building and the rich infrastructure above was approved by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia. Manage schools and district authorities on the occasion of Samdech presiding over the inauguration ceremony of National Road 55 in the past.
The district governor added that on that occasion, Samdech Techo Hun Sen provided a school building to Hun Sen Primary School, a three-story trunk with 18 rooms, a library office with three rooms, and a concrete road, gate and fence.
At the same time, Samdech Techo HUN SEN also provided an additional school building to Hun Sen High School, a 3-storey building with 18 rooms, an office and a library with 3 rooms, a dormitory for students and teachers, a 2-storey building with 10 rooms. Also prepare concrete roads, gates, school fences and volleyball tables in the school.
Mr. Heng Sopheana continued that these are all the vision of Samdech Techo Hun Sen to help improve the education sector as well as bring the school closer to the students so that they can easily and have the opportunity to study like other students. Others fit the desire.
