Sky Villa Apartment is a luxuriously designed twin mansion with 35 floors equal to 140 meters. Both the unique design and the service in the building offer the convenience as well as the luxury of living. Sky Villa Apartment is a new landmark that can see the growth and beauty of Phnom Penh.
Walking into this building you will see that all the grass and wood, bricks and tiles and even the air show the comfort, coziness and prominence of modern luxury homes. A good reception hall will guide you to create a cozy feeling of home. This is complemented by an abundance of large gardens, spacious terraces and even a full sports area for you to exercise and relax at home.
