(Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, on Monday morning, February 1, 2021, continued to open the groundbreaking ceremony and inaugurate new achievements for the nation and the people of Cambodia. The second public appearance of Samdech Techo Hun Sen at the beginning of 2021 is the opening ceremony of the construction site of Bak Kheng Water Treatment Plant and the inauguration ceremony of Chamkar Mon Water Treatment Plant.
On the occasion of the inauguration, Samdech Techo Hun Sen delivered a speech for about 2 hours, the following are the main remarks of Samdech Techo:
Samdech Techo Hun Sen Presides Over a Groundbreaking Ceremony for the Construction of Bak Kheng Water Treatment Plant and the Inauguration Ceremony of Chamkar Mon Water Treatment Plant on Monday, February 01
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces support for the slogan raised by Senior Minister Cham Prasidh "Clean water for all".
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that this water policy determination shows the strong commitment of the Royal Government to solve the water problem of the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that the politics of water, roads, electricity and human resources have been mentioned since Samdech went to participate in peace talks in France in 1987.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen considered today's program as the second exercise for the program in the context of Kovid 19.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen called the achievement of the current water treatment plant a cooperation between Cambodia and the French government and the European Union.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Bak Kheng water treatment plant cost about 247 million US dollars. Of that, the budget for the construction of the factory is 155.5 million dollars and the distribution network is 91.5 million dollars.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the construction project of Bak Kheng Water Treatment Plant, Phase 1 and 2, will cost 348 million USD. The first and second steps can produce about 390,000 cubic meters of clean water per day.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen highly appreciated and appreciated the efforts of the Ministry of Industry, Science, Technology and Innovation in building this water treatment plant.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen commemorates the background of Mr. Cham Prasidh, who started from Samdech's personal assistant and has been with Samdech for about 40 years
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Chamkar Mon Water Treatment Plant with a budget of 47.1 million USD can produce 52,000 cubic meters of water per day.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that the development area along the boulevard was a shelter of the Khmer Rouge and was brought by the officials to cut down the forest here so that the Khmer Rouge would not hide.
* Samdech Techo reminded that the clean water network in Phnom Penh was used before the genocidal regime of Pol Pot, but this network was completely destroyed during this genocidal regime.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that Samdech lost an unborn child because Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen used water on his house. Samdech Techo stated that it was not until 1994 that Samdech's house had running water.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia was a country that suffered from the genocidal regime of Pol Pot, but was punished by a democracy.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that democracies have never expressed their regret for past mistakes by supporting the Khmer Rouge regime.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that during the epidemic of Kovid 19, Cambodia was still able to repay foreign debt.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that Cambodia suffered from the previous generation, created war, the next generation went to end the war and make peace.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked France and the European Union for helping to build a water treatment plant.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that regarding the arrest of leaders and presidents in Myanmar, Cambodia did not issue any message regarding Myanmar's internal affairs.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in Phnom Penh, the Japanese government has helped a lot on water issues.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the demand for water in Phnom Penh is increasing every day, so efforts must be made to develop the capacity to produce and supply clean water.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that all state institutions must pay attention to reducing the use of electricity and water.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that the Ministry of State institutions should not turn on the air conditioner too much and turn off the lights.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in 2019, the Royal Government invested directly with a budget of $ 594 million. Of which, direct investment is 514 million dollars, 79 million dollars is the contribution budget.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that wars in the past have left many scars for Cambodia, but Cambodia has made efforts to recover.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the politics of water, roads, electricity and human resources will continue to be in line with the situation in Cambodia for the next 50 years.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the condition of Kovid 19 has not improved. Samdech Techo asked for the understanding of all people, especially those who are doing satalysak can not reduce the number of days.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen has announced that those who come to Cambodia must have a 14-day health and cataract test.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech entered many battlefields and negotiations, but was never shocked by the problem. But the battle and the Battle of Kovid for 19 days, Samdech had to shake his hand.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the success of the fight against Kovid 19 in the past due to the participation of the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the King, Queen, monks and all the people who provided royal gifts and assistance to buy vaccines. Samdech Techo said that these royal gestures and gestures show the spirit of unity in Cambodian society.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reacts to the EU's vaccine blocking measures. Samdech Techo stated that the world considers vaccines as a common commodity. Samdech Techo Hun Sen, through the European Embassy, helped bring this message to the European Union.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen confirms the source of the vaccine that Cambodia will receive about 20 million doses. Of that, 1 million dollars from China (600,000 dollars as of February), 7 million dollars from Kovak, which is owned by the World Health Organization, 1 million dollars bought from Kuwait, and 3 million dollars from Australia. Million doses. In addition, Cambodia is considering buying from the United Kingdom.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the army doctors have already been trained in the vaccination operation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that if a dose of vaccine costs between 4 and 5 dollars, the royal gift of the King and Queen, as well as the participation of the Cambodian people more than 57 million dollars is enough.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces request for vaccine assistance from the European Union and the European Union.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that do not say that Cambodia sees or needs only China. Cambodian politics needs everything around it.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that according to the assessment, Cambodia can refine between 7,000 and 7,500 barrels per day, which is a small amount, but a good step on the oil sector in Cambodia. . Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that oil revenues have not yet reached the Cambodian economy.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in 2021, Cambodia expects to achieve 4% economic growth, but must work together to prevent the spread of Kovid 19.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in the face of the Kovid 19 crisis, Samdech did not declare the country in a state of emergency in any part or the whole country.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen ended his speech at 10:17 am on February 1, 2021. Secretary of State for the Ministry of Interior Ang Mongkul donates 1.5 million six months' salary to the Ministry of Health for the fight against Kovid 19
