(Phnom Penh): Lt. Gen. Lim Sokharasmey, Director of the Private Security Management Department of the General Commission of the National Police, on the morning of February 1, 2021, expressed his gratitude and appreciation to all private security agencies who participated in the prevention and control of smallpox. -19 According to the instructions of the Ministry of Health.
