443 Chhlong residents announced to be members of the Cambodian People's Party
(Kratie): The values of nation building, maturity and clear leadership structure of the Cambodian People's Party have made the people confident and strong. This trust has made the Cambodian people support and submit themselves to serve the party's path for the benefit of society and the people.
Chhlong district, Kratie province, a province in the northeast of the country and once devastated by the flames of war, has now become a land of peace, development and remarkable progress. The achievements that have been shown to the people have made the local people believe and strongly support the Cambodian People's Party.
On January 31, 2021, about 443 Chhlong residents volunteered to join the political life and serve the path of the Cambodian People's Party. The new party membership ceremony was presided over by Mr. Vath Thorn, Chairman of the Central Committee of the Cambodian People's Party in Kratie Province.
On the occasion of joining the new CPP, Mr. Vathorn said that the high decision to join the CPP was the right decision because the CPP has liberated the people from the genocidal regime. Pol Pot, the second survival of the Cambodian people under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party.
"The CPP is the oldest political party, with sufficient human resources and a strong structure at all levels," he said. In particular, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the President of the Party and the Prime Minister, who has the wisdom, wisdom and confidence, has made the country peaceful throughout the country and has made Cambodia prosperous and developing in all areas from the city. "Up to the countryside."
On that occasion, Mr. Vathorn asked the new party members to continue to support the Samdech's leadership policy and participate in building and developing the country of Cambodia to move forward and be a good youth for the grassroots and society. He also asked the members to work hard to serve the party, especially the local people with all their strength to participate in building a more prosperous country.
On that occasion, Mr. Vathorn handed over a computer, a printer and $ 200 to the commune administration and also donated 20,000 Riels to each of the 443 new members.
Cambodian Youth Movement Association 157 Committed to Maintaining Peace for National Development
(Kampong Chhnang): The Cambodian Youth Movement Association 157, chaired by Mr. Moeng Ponlok, values the peace that is plaguing the motherland of Cambodia. The youth movement, which is the son of a leader, an official of the armed forces and a government official, has shown the highest level of commitment to maintaining this peace.
On the afternoon of January 30, 2021, Mr. Moeng Ponlok, President of the Cambodian Youth Movement Association 157, stated that the establishment of the Cambodian Youth Movement Association 157 is for the purpose of youth movement in all areas to help people affected by disasters to help people with disabilities. Help the elderly, regardless of political affiliation, race or color, to join the Royal Government in safeguarding peace so that the nation can develop.
In this ceremony, Mr. Moeung Ponlok reminded about the background and some activities of the Cambodian Youth Movement Association 157. Mr. Moeung Ponlok said that as of today, the Cambodian Youth Movement Association 157 has been established in 14 provinces, including branches in Kampong Chhnang.
He added that in the past, the association has helped more than 500 families affected by the floods in 2019 in some provinces. Last year in Siem Reap, the association also organized a youth movement in Siem Reap to ride a bicycle together to raise more than $ 80,000 to support Kantha Bopha Hospital.
At the same time, 12 years ago, when the country was at war on the Cambodian-Thai border, the Cambodian Youth Movement Association also mobilized young people across the country and other institutions to jointly support fighters on the front lines, making the fighters defend their homeland. Succeeded by the enemies who tried to occupy the territory of Preah Vihear temple, which is the heritage of Khmer ancestors.
Mr. Sun Sovannarith, Deputy Governor of Kampong Chhnang Province, who presided over the ceremony, said that in Kampong Chhnang, there are more than 100 associations with a total of more than 30,000 families, and in the future, all associations in the province and expand its membership. 200,000 families to improve his livelihood at the grassroots level.
Mr. Moeng Ponlok requested the leaders of the Cambodian Youth Movement Association 157 to support the Agricultural Crops Association in Teuk Hot Commune and the Tourism Association at Sre Ampil Waterfall, which is developing well to promote activities that are developing in In the association.
The president of the 157 Cambodian Youth Movement Association also called on all local authorities in the province to cooperate with the 157 Cambodian Youth Movement Association and all communities in the province to jointly develop the local community to be successful and to keep the peace.
This program aims to inspire its 68 members to better understand and love to maintain and protect the national peace that the Cambodian People's Party under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen has worked hard to build and grow. Know the development to this day.
According to the source, his team really values peace, so he named his team "Peace Golf Team" in line with the current peaceful country.
