Kong Sarun has already lost the case in the Court of First Instance and the Court of Appeal (March 16, 2017). And finally, the Supreme Court needs more evidence from Kong Sarun.
Mr. Kong Sarun took the certificate from the Department of Land No. 155 Donsorsor dated February 14, 2018 to the Supreme Court, and on January 27, 2021, the Supreme Court announced the verdict. Mr. Kong Sarun won the case completely.
Mr. Kong Sarun and his wife and seven children expressed their deepest gratitude to Prime Minister Samdech Techo Hun Sen for delivering the justice he has been waiting for for the past 26 years.
Mr. Duong Dara, Samdech Techo's Assistant, also expressed his deep gratitude to Samdech for giving him the opportunity to help mediate and resolve disputes for the people outside the court system based on the principle of winning and defeating Samdech Techo. At the same time, Mr. Duong Dara also thanked for the cooperation with all relevant authorities who have contributed to the resolution of this dispute to the people.
