Minister Thong Khon Instructs New Kratie Tourism Director to Boost Domestic Tourism Movement, Strengthen Kovid 19 Fighting and Implement Tourism Safety Rules
(Kratie): In the inauguration ceremony of the new Director of the Department of Tourism of Kratie Province, Mr. Thong Khon, Minister of Tourism, introduced many recommendations to the new Director of the Department, especially to strengthen the fight against Kovid-19 and Consistently implement tourism safety rules as well as increase the promotion of community-based tourism products to encourage more local tourists to visit Kratie.
The inauguration ceremony was held on the afternoon of January 29, 2021 at Kratie University with the participation of Mr. Hoeur Siyem, Chairman of Kratie Provincial Council and Mr. Vathon, Governor of Kratie Province. Mr. Chan Sokunthy has been appointed Director of the Kratie Provincial Department of Tourism, replacing Mr. Chuob Ratana, who has been transferred to the Ministry of Tourism.
He stressed that all businesses, services and destinations must ensure the safety of tourists, especially the implementation of three main principles: wearing a mask, washing hands and keeping a safe distance.
Regarding the management and development of the tourism sector, the Minister instructed the new director of the department to be ready to participate in the preparation of the master plan for tourism development in Kratie province, and this plan must be submitted to the provincial board of governors and the Ministry of Tourism for review and approval from the Royal Government. Special area development plan is Mekong River dolphins.
In addition, it is necessary to study the potential of tourism sites that can become tourism and ecotourism communities, and to take care of, protect and develop existing tourism and ecotourism community areas, especially to strive to create a tour package. One of Kratie by connecting from one destination to another or connecting to other destinations in collaboration with the surrounding Department of Tourism.
In addition, the private sector must be encouraged to invest more in tourism, especially in the development of resorts and tourism communities in Kratie. To organize more tourism, culture and sports events for the province.
Mr. Thong Khon further advised that the Provincial Department of Tourism must strengthen the promotion and production of tourism brochures for Kratie in all forms, especially through information technology, in collaboration with the provincial administration, companies, associations and the private sector. Strengthen the management of provincial tourism information centers or booths in collaboration with the private sector.
Strengthen the management of the tourism industry, especially encourage all tourism businesses and services to do business legally and have a real license, as well as promote the implementation of online tourism licensing and promote the implementation of tourism service standards set by the Ministry. .
At the same time, it is necessary to cooperate with the provincial authorities and departments, specialized units to promote the preparation of food streets in accordance with the principles and to strengthen the clean city to participate in the 3rd Clean City Competition 2021-2023 for Kratie. Can lead to receive the prize of "3 romduol flowers".
