Please be informed that the Cambodian Embassy in Malaysia has intervened to help six Cambodian workers and one baby to return home on the evening of January 27, 2021. This is according to Mr. Koy Kuong.
Mr. Koy Kuong said that with the intervention of the Embassy, 6 Cambodian workers and 1 baby arrived at Phnom Penh International Airport by Singapore Airlines Flight SQ5008 on January 27, 2021 at 05:35. Evening.
