At the same time, the Governor informed the World Bank about the status and progress of the economic and financial sector, that the Cambodian banking sector continues to be stable and actively contributes to supporting economic activities in line with the Royal Government's policies.
The World Bank highly appreciates the measures taken by the National Bank of Cambodia in responding to the pressure of slowing economic growth effectively and in a timely manner, as well as contributing to the support of economic activity.
