Court detains drunk man who hit and killed young woman
(Phnom Penh): The Investigating Judge of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court, Mr. Long Vanna, on January 28, 2021, ordered the detention of Mr. Koam Sithon, 42 years old, in Prey Sor Prison in connection with the case of drunk driving and hitting women. One dies while she has only 10 days left to get married.
Defendant Koam Sithon was charged by Prosecutor Say Nora with "reckless driving, negligence, or negligence in causing death" under Article 85 of the Road Traffic Law and Article 44, Article 124 of the Penal Code. Code of Criminal Procedure. He faces up to five to five years in prison for the offense.
