(Siem Reap): The Inter-Ministerial Working Group on Management and Development of Community-Based Tourism and Ecotourism (OCCA), the organizer of the 2nd National Ecotourism Forum 2021, has been leading trainees who are civil servants. A total of nearly 300 community tour operators and stakeholders visited six well-known communities in Siem Reap on January 28.
Mr. Chuk Chumnor, Director of the Department of Tourism Product Development of the Ministry of Tourism, said that the communities that the team is preparing to bring the six participants to visit include:
Bakong community, my village is located in Thnal Trang village, Bakong commune, Prasat Bakong district.
Phnom Kulen community is located in Kulen village, Khnong Phnom commune, Svay Leu district.
Teuk Chob Khnar Po Natural Cultural Community is located in Chob Village, Khnar Po Commune, Sot Nikum District.
Boeung Chhouk Banteay Srey community is located in Banteay Srey village, Khnar Sanday commune, Banteay Srey district.
Kampong Phluk Ecotourism Community is located in Kork Kdol Village, Kampong Phluk Commune, Prasat Bakong District.
* Run Ta Ek Natural Village Community is located in Tani Village, Run Ta Ek Commune, Banteay Srey District.
Mr. Chuk Chumnor said that the purpose of organizing the visit to these communities was to reflect what was discussed in the forum on the first day, as the first day shared many experiences related to Manage the community as well as the challenges that arise in each community. In addition, the visit was also to find out what the unique features and potentials of the management of the six communities are.
The head of the active department added that after receiving information or finding any problems when returning, those issues will be raised directly at the closing ceremony of the second National Ecotourism Forum. Mr. Thong Khon, Minister of Tourism, will lead the discussion at the closing of the forum and there is an immediate solution, but if there are any issues that can not be resolved immediately, the relevant ministries and institutions will discuss and resolve later.
