This statement was made by the senior official at the public forum on macroeconomic management and financial law for management 2021 this morning, January 27, 2021.
He said the new investment law had been finalized and would probably be discussed by the Economic and Financial Policy Committee in February and then submitted to the cabinet. If all goes well, it is likely that by April this year, the new law will reach the National Assembly and the Senate and will be able to pass it.
He said that for the new law related to taxes, under the old law, investors have to pay some taxes related to some utilities in the project, but for the new law, he does not have to pay for any imports that are Entry into production.
He said that the old law and the new law are different, as we now think about boosting investment in both human and technical resources, and the new law has a clear division of industries.
