Citizen's opinion: Please save the squid, shrimp and biodiversity in the Khmer Sea from the illegal fishing boat, the night in the middle of the sea is as bright as the city because of the fishing boat!
(Koh Kong): Large fishing boats using electric lights and nets often violate the law, fishing activities to destroy all kinds of fish and biodiversity in the sea has been claimed by fishermen for many years, never seen the authorities Any skill comes out to crack down effectively once in a while.
A fisherman who parked his boat near Koh Sdech told Neay Khvek that fishing is very difficult now because small fishing boats do not dare to go out in the middle of the sea for fear of fishing waves only near the island or in the area. With only rocks at the bottom of the sea, the area where no rocks grow easily, the nets were dragged away by all the illegal sailors, leaving no fishing grounds.
As for our small boats, when fishing encounters large illegal boats, we must hurry to open the boat to escape, otherwise face danger because the big illegal boats, it sails or crashes because illegal fishing boats need a location on the sea that does not exist. Large stones for setting nets, dragging fish, squid, shrimp and so on.
The fishermen complained that in the past, on the islands or near the islands in the middle of the sea, the perpetrators used bombs to catch fish, but now the fish near the beach or near the island is becoming scarcer. Now more and more boats use electric lights to haul nets, more and more illegal fish, crabs, shrimp, squid are almost gone, sometimes they do not want to fish for fuel.
The seller said that most of the illegal fishing boats do not belong to the Cambodians, but to the Thai owners, because each boat and fishing gear worth millions of baht, Cambodian fishermen can not afford to buy fishing.
The above is just information on the concerns of some people who were questioned by Neay Khvek on the owners of rented boats for fishing and fishermen, seafood sellers in the area of King Island. Therefore, the competent officials, please help to check and take measures to crack down, especially the Fisheries Administration, Ministry of Agriculture, whether fishing boats use lights like the city, as evident, this is an illegal or legal fishing boat.
This picture was taken by Neay Khvek's mobile phone on the night of January 23, 2021, taken from the Hindu area and is also clear evidence of wrongdoing.
