(Phnom Penh): Lt. Gen. Pen Phal Piseth, Deputy Secretary General of the Ministry of National Defense, stated that the army must be capable, disciplined, dignified and responsible, and must work hard to learn and strengthen the technology to be able to receive the new technology of the digital age. The army must be strong to defend and must not be shaken by the instigation of some unscrupulous group.
This statement was made by Lt. Gen. Pen Phal Piseth at the dissemination of psychological education on the current situation and leadership development to officers and soldiers from the Ministry of National Defense on the morning of the 27th. January 2021 at the Ministry of National Defense.
On that occasion, before the start of the program, Lt. Gen. Pen Phal Piseth uttered three words: Thank you, peace! Thank you, politics wins! Grateful to the founders, guides and win-win political operations that bring complete peace and national unity!
At the same time, Lt. Gen. Pen Phal Piseth said that under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of the Kingdom of Cambodia, Samdech was very smart and flexible, maintaining 100% stability and health security in Cambodia. As the number one model in the world, even though Cambodia is a small country.
Through all the sacrifices made for the cause of Samdech Techo Hun Sen's motherland, Lt. Gen. Pen Phal Piseth added: "As an army, we must protect the Royal Government, protect peace, protect everything that the Royal "The government has done and set out for us to act as the army must be strong and protect not to be shaken by the instigation of some biased group."
In addition, the lieutenant general also emphasized that no matter who says what, it does not matter, but what is important is on the truth of what the government can do, building from scratch to do. Let Cambodia prosper in all areas, make people live under the roof of peace.
Lt. Gen. Pen Phal Piseth continued that the army is the main core force of the nation. Therefore, there must be strong unity, loyalty, conscience, good attitude and work activities. Must strive to increase their capacity as much as possible, seek knowledge and use knowledge for the benefit of the nation, for the benefit of the organization, but must stay away from the interests of individuals.
