Ms. Chow Winsing, Political Adviser of the Chinese Embassy in Cambodia, praised the efforts of the Chinese Cultural Center in Cambodia, which has always cooperated well with relevant units under the Ministry of Culture and Fine Arts to share experiences and learn from Mutual, in particular, is a good link between the people and the people of the two countries.
She expressed confidence that the arrival of the panda art exhibition will promote cultural exchanges between China and Cambodia, promote deep understanding and friendship between the people of the two countries, and add new elements to cooperation. Cultural transactions between China and Cambodia.
