Coalition of Small and Medium Enterprises Association joins hands with SBI Ly Hour Bank to strengthen successful business building
(Phnom Penh): The Coalition of Small and Medium Enterprises Association of Cambodia and SBI Ly Hour Bank CKT this morning, January 25, 2021, signed a Memorandum of Understanding in the presence of Mr. Oknha Te Tang Po, President of the Association. And Tycoon Ly Hour, Chairman of the Board of Directors of SBI Ly Hour CMC for Successful Business Building.
Mr. Oknha Te Taing Po stated that the purpose of this Memorandum of Understanding is to develop a strategic partnership to collaborate on successful business building workshops for Cambodian SMEs in 25 capitals and provinces from From February 1, 2021 to January 31, 2022, it is planned to invite 2,500 members of small and medium enterprises across 25 capitals and provinces to participate.
In addition, SBI Ly Hour Bank is a keynote speaker in the program that presents the use and effective management of finances to obtain financing and to promote its products or services.
