Please be informed that Ly Hour Group has established Ly Hour Microfinance Institution since 2012. Seeing the progress of Ly Hour Microfinance Institution, SBI Holding, which has a strong base in Japan, has entered into an investment partnership with Ly Hour Microfinance Institution to transform itself into a commercial bank. Named SBI Ly Hour Bank Plc.
This investment shows the growing confidence of foreign investors in Cambodia's economic growth. We all know that the financial sector is growing in our country and this sector is an important backbone to boost economic growth and the Royal Government is pushing for this sector as well.
