Please note that there are more than 200 contract teachers in Svay Chrum district, 60,000 riel per person per year, what is the money used for? The relevant ministries should look into this matter, it has been for many years.
Sources revealed to Fresh News that after an inquiry, now the leadership of the provincial Department of Education, Youth and Sports has asked the contract teachers who applied for the contract teachers to pay and come back to the school. Some students who have applied for unpaid work do not need to be taken to the district education office to deal with because it is not the policy of the Ministry of Education.
