(Kampong Cham): Mr. HUN Neng, Member of Parliament for Kampong Cham Constituency, this morning, January 22, 2021, led a delegation to pay homage to the late Heng Nim, the father of Brigadier General Heng Vuthy, Deputy Police Commissioner of Kampong Cham and father-in-law. Mrs. Try Sokha, Samdech Techo Hun Sen Protocol.
