The above operation was carried out by the specialized police force of the Anti-Drug Office of Kampong Chhnang Provincial Police, led by Lieutenant Colonel Kim San, Deputy Director of the Anti-Drug Bureau, in cooperation with the Boribo District Police Inspectorate under the coordination of the Prosecutor's Office.
