* With his first public appearance for 2021, Samdech Techo Hun Sen wished all Cambodians a happy new year.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen considered the inauguration ceremony of the Ministry of Public Works and Transport this morning as an exercise and experience for the program in the context of Kovid 19 disease or as a new program.
