* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also confirmed that the Ministry of National Defense and the Ministry of Industry, Science, Technology and Innovation are also under construction.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that regime changes in Cambodia as well as in other countries, whether by election or coup d'etat, always inherited from the previous government. But for Cambodia after the liberation from the genocidal regime, Cambodia has nothing left, including the infrastructure to lead the state, the infrastructure of ministries, state institutions, including human resources.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that Samdech has made efforts to regroup human resources and reorganized the most difficult ministries and institutions.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that Samdech Vibol Panha Sok An and Senior Minister Cham Prasidh were senior personal secretaries of Samdech.
