* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that for the Ministry of Public Works and Transport from the beginning, it was just the Public Works, Transport and Post Commission.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech is even happier for the Ministry of Public Works and Transport, as well as some other ministries to establish human resource training facilities. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that human resources are still important and highly considered for Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Phnom Penh has developed from an area of 300 square kilometers to more than 700 square kilometers.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech is really tired of the repeated mention of deleting lakes in Phnom Penh. Samdech Techo said that in Phnom Penh, there are many lakes, but have been removed from previous generations to serve the development and livelihood of the people.
