* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech still respects King Ang Duong. According to Samdech Techo, Cambodia in the past has almost disappeared from the world map. Samdech Techo stated that during the 1840s, Cambodia had less than 1 million people. Samdech Techo stated that King Ang Duong worked very hard for Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in order to evaluate and predict the situation, Samdech used three methods, including: First. History, II. Criticism and 3rd. Logic.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech was not only the commander of the United Front for National Salvation, but also the founder of this force.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen invites Mr. Mak Horn to visit Cambodia by paying the airfare.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that "win-win politics" is the only way to end the flames of war. In particular, political struggles are common for democracies.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen encouraged the training of human resources because human resources are a necessary factor.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen continues to confirm the Kovid 19 vaccine, stating the reasons why he decided to get the vaccine from China now, although the World Health Organization has not yet officially announced.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that while Cambodia is being harassed by Kovid 19, it is no longer possible to wait, it is necessary to seek free and voluntary vaccinations for the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he had sent a letter to the Chinese Prime Minister and met with the Chinese Ambassador to Cambodia to discuss and find out the mechanism for obtaining the vaccine.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he had already written a letter to the Prime Minister of India requesting that the vaccine be given to the people. Samdech Techo also considered writing a letter requesting a vaccine from South Korea.
* Samdech Techo stated that Samdech is considering and studying the British vaccine as well.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Sinofam vaccine will arrive in Cambodia for the first time in February and that he will go to the airport to receive the vaccine.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Kovid 19 vaccine is a strategic commodity. Samdech Techo reaffirmed that vaccination is based on a voluntary principle, so anyone who wants to be vaccinated, if not, is not forced.
* However, Samdech believes that the vaccination will follow the same requirements as the malaria vaccine before entering Africa. Therefore, in the case of the Kovid 19 vaccine, Samdech Techo estimates that in the future, countries may require a certificate of vaccination against any person before being allowed to enter another country.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the vaccination will also give investors confidence without considering Cambodia as a country endangered by Kovid 19.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces the first dose of the Chinese Kovid 19 vaccine, the first injection, and hopes that other senior leaders will also be vaccinated. Samdech Techo confirmed that after the injection, Samdech will hold a press conference as well.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed the expectation that before the Khmer New Year, Kovid 19 vaccine will be given to 500,000 people. Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that garbage collectors must also be vaccinated.
