(Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, on Friday morning, January 22, 2021, inaugurated the new achievements of the Ministry of Public Works and Transport, including the new office building and the Techo Sen Institute of Public Works and Transport.
Senior Minister Sun Chanthol stated that this new achievement in the land of peace that emerges is an invaluable bond of the Royal Government of Cambodia to all civil servants, as well as the people and society as a whole. Under the wise leadership and long-term vision of the Prime Minister, the Chinese C919 successfully flew test flights in the cold.
The C919 is China's first developed aircraft with a range of 158 to 174 seats and a range of 4,075 to 5,555 kilometers. The aircraft was removed from the production line in 2015 and successfully flew its first test flight in 2017. The aircraft is expected to receive aviation certification by the aviation authority and will be launched this year.
