On Wednesday afternoon (US time), US President-elect Joe Biden was officially sworn in as the 46th President of the United States, succeeding former President Donald Trump. Wild honey of Aboun Leu community in Mondulkiri province is ready to register as a GI product
(Mondulkiri): According to Mr. Chan Laly, CIRD official told reporters during the information mission in Aboun Leu community, Koh Nhek district, Mondulkiri province, that the wild honey of Mondulkiri community is ready to be registered as a product. Geographically, do not allow other honey products to falsify the name of Mondulkiri honey.
Wild honey is the second occupation of farmers outside of farm work, and this authority and partner organizations advise the community to implement and follow the techniques to avoid killing bees in the hive.
According to Mr. Chan Laly, he added, "At this time, we have almost 100 percent ready documents to register with the Ministry of Commerce. "Register the wild honey has the right intellectual property to jointly maintain the reputation of the community."
He said that the indigenous people in each area continue to work for wild bees to sell to earn a living after farming and together to preserve the business identity from their ancestors.
According to Mr. Kanh Bophat, the head of the Prey Robang indigenous bee collector group, “In one year, 20 to 30 tons are usually collected into the community, plus 70 tons are exported to the community. In the whole of Mondulkiri province, the honey that his community collects is all honey. ”
Mr. Bophat added that the Abon Leu community was established 13 years ago, and the establishment of this community has greatly reduced deforestation because people do not yet understand the importance of forests. Therefore, through community mobilization, people are turning their attention to forest conservation because they can earn money by selling wild honey to customers at an affordable price.
Mr. Kanh Bophat stated that in order to facilitate the livelihood of the ethnic minorities who are organized as a community, he collected from them to find a market for them to facilitate their lives better.
