(Phnom Penh): The Phnom Penh Capital Administration plans to renovate the park in front of the Ministry of National Defense to improve the beauty of the city, make it easier for people to travel and have a large yard for people to exercise.
The plan to improve the park in front of the Ministry of National Defense along the Russian Federation Road was mentioned in a joint meeting between the Phnom Penh Capital Administration and the Ministry of National Defense on the morning of January 21, 2021 in order to make the park This is more beautiful and in harmony with the entrance to the Ministry of Defense.
Mr. Khuong Sreng, Governor of Phnom Penh, said that the Phnom Penh Capital Administration fully supports the project to improve the park because it has helped to make this road more beautiful while many international tourists pass through.
He advised the professional officers of the administration and the Ministry of National Defense to study the project to improve the park clearly and harmoniously between the old garden and the new garden to make this area beautiful as well as the Phnom Penh administration. Make a beautiful stone fence in front of the Council of Ministers, improve two deer roundabouts and set up a traffic system.
He stated that the park improvement project could be completed simultaneously with the construction of the new Ministry of National Defense building, which is scheduled to be officially inaugurated under the presidency of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia in June. This year 2021. Then the area will have easy traffic flow again, no more congestion like today.
Lt. Gen. Nget Narin, Deputy Director General of the General Department of Logistics and Finance and the Engineering Department of the Ministry of National Defense, said that the project to improve the park in front of the Ministry of National Defense not only enhances the beauty of both the Ministry and the park. Not only that, it is also open to easy access.
Please note that according to the project to improve the garden in front of the Ministry of National Defense, the old garden will be cut up to 45 meters long to prepare the entrance to the Ministry, and the new garden will be made of granite, planted with grass, equipped with lights that enable people There is a convenient gym with a larger location.
