Senior Minister Kun Kim said that in order to improve the lives of veterans, Samdech Techo has provided land for housing, land for cultivation and various policy regimes. Mr. Kun Kim said that through the high attention of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the veterans lived a better life and had a decent shelter.
Senior Minister Kun Kim said that to date, Samdech Techo Hun Sen has provided more than 5 million dollars to build houses for Cambodian veterans.
"Samdech Techo Hun Sen pays great attention to the well-being of veterans. "He always encourages and reminds us to pay attention to life, look at housing, if you have difficulties, you must help immediately." This was confirmed by the Senior Minister, Secretary General of the Cambodian Veterans Association.
