In order to successfully participate in the implementation of the political program and continue the implementation of the implementation of the fourth phase of the Rectangular Strategy of the Royal Government of the sixth mandate of the National Assembly, Mr. Chea Bora urged the working group to work together to complete the main tasks for 2021 as follows:
