Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng Distributes Diplomas to 2,023 Students at Battambang National University
(Battambang): Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Interior and Chairman of the Battambang Provincial Working Group, distributed diplomas to 2,023 undergraduate and graduate students at the National University of Battambang.
The ceremony was attended by a delegation accompanied by MPs, Chairman of the Working Group, Mr. Sar Sokha, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports, Provincial Board of Governors, Rector of the National University of Battambang, leaders, government officials around the province, teachers, students also attended.
Mr. Sok Khorn, Rector of the National University of Battambang, made a brief report on the training of 20,000 students in the field of education so far and 90% of the jobs have been found.
Samdech Sar Kheng recalled the history of the National University of Battambang in the past and had a talk on the occasion of the graduation ceremony for 2,023 students of the National University of Battambang. To progress to this day.
Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng thanked the professors, teachers, especially the Rector of the National University of Battambang, who worked hard to train our students with good quality, efficiency and high responsibility for applying knowledge to the job market. The future to contribute to building and developing our nation as well.
Samdech continued that students who have received proper education and training, as well as building more good human resources is a very important resource for the labor market and contribute to reducing poverty of our people, we have a lot of good quality human resources. We want to do anything.
"The head of the Royal Government of Cambodia has given priority to the education sector, which has played its most important role in building human resources to develop the country to grow significantly in the future."
Samdech instructed all students to participate in preventing Kovid-19 infection by following the instructions of the Ministry of Health on a regular basis. In the end, Samdech also presented diplomas to some symbolic students.
