FUNCINPEC announces that Norodom Ranariddh is trying to find a plane back to Cambodia to lead the party
(Phnom Penh): After a long period of medical treatment abroad, Samdech Norodom Ranariddh, President of FUNCINPEC, will return to the position of President of the Royal Party in the near future. . This is according to Mr. Heng Chantha, Vice President of FUNCINPEC.
Heng Chantha confirmed in a press conference on January 19, 2021 that today, Prince Norodom Ranariddh has recovered from his health and is able to lead the party while he is currently in office. Still in France and trying to find a flight back to Cambodia.
Mr. Heng Chantha continued that the structure under the leadership of Prince Norodom Ranariddh has been prepared, there are all levels from top to bottom to fill vacancies, the gap has been filled by the party, for example. Like the post of Executive Secretary, which was not yet in place, the party has now appointed a successor and is actively working.
Mr. Heng Chantha added that Samdech Preah Prasat has pushed all the work to the local level and the subordinates are continuing to visit the local level, and in recent weeks, they have already visited the provincial level 3-4. Will continue to visit other provinces.
FUNCINPEC calls on former activists who once supported FUNCINPEC, patriots, royalists, Sihanouk, FUNCINPEC to rejoin FUNCINPEC, while the party remains open to welcoming without discrimination One nation participates in solving national problems with other patriotic forces.
The vice president of the Royalist Party also stated that FUNCINPEC is an alliance party with the Cambodian People's Party, so FUNCINPEC can not act as an opposition party, even if the former CNRP, which was a bigger opposition party, was dissolved. And only joint efforts to build the nation to continue to grow.
Please be informed that on August 08, 2018, Samdech Krom Preah Norodom Ranariddh appointed one of his sons, Prince Norodom Chakravuth, as the Acting President of FUNCINPEC Royalist Party, who was still receiving medical treatment at No, after a traffic accident in 2018, he later appointed Prince Chakravuth as vice president.
Samdech Krom Preah Norodom Ranariddh was seriously injured in a horrific traffic accident caused by a taxi overtaking another car and crashing into his procession in Prey Nob District, Sihanoukville Province on June 17, 2018. . The accident caused the death of Miss Ouk Phalla Ranariddh, along with several other passengers. As for Samdech Krom Preah, he was sent for treatment abroad.
After Prince Norodom Ranariddh met with a traffic accident in 2018, the political activities of FUNCINPEC have decreased significantly, almost making the electorate forget as the age of Samdech Preah President. Older.
