(Svay Rieng): Consumer Protection, Competition and Fraud Officers of Svay Rieng Provincial Branch led by Mr. Pheng Nil, Provincial Branch Manager, cooperated with the Provincial Department of Commerce and local authorities on the morning of January 19, 2021. This inspected the food products and packaged goods at the stalls in Kampong Chak market, Romduol district, Svay Rieng province, as a result, found soybeans containing chemicals.
