Ministry of Water Resources issues the first weather forecast for the dry season and early rainy season 2021
According to the announcement, after monitoring and forecasting the weather conditions, the Ministry of Water Resources would like to inform the public about the weather conditions for the dry season and early rainy season 2021 as follows:
Based on international and regional assessments of the Pacific Ocean conditions near the equator, Cambodia will be affected by the ENSO.
Examining the effects of the above two phenomena, the weather conditions for the dry season and the beginning of the rainy season in 2021 will be favorable.
* April and early May: Maximum temperatures may reach a maximum of 39 ° C.
Although there may be heavy rainfall in April and early April, the amount of rainfall is not enough to meet the immediate needs.
Therefore, please continue to save and use water sparingly, especially in remote rural areas far from water sources.
