Mr. Sar Sokha further stated that professors, teachers act as individuals, parents, researchers, consultants and innovators, and strive to develop their skills in terms of knowledge and teaching methods, including the use. Foreign language information technology to bring new knowledge, new talents to train students to have a wide range of knowledge and develop themselves as successors for the future.
Meanchey University must strive to strengthen its potential in terms of physical infrastructure, teaching and learning services to be suitable as a place for education and training to determine cleanliness, good behavior and no mental or physical harassment.
Deputy Commander of the 70th Brigade, Ms. Khay Narin, continues to deny the land-related allegations in Keo Phos commune, Stung Hav district, as the burglars on her land have gradually admitted the truth.
(Sihanoukville): Although some people who had previously cheated and stole to build a factory on her land came out to acknowledge the truth, but still a small group of people continue to accuse To Ms. Khay Narin, Deputy Commander of the 70th Brigade, as the person who went to encroach on the land.
On January 18, 2021, Major General Khay Narin, 62, Deputy Commander of the 70th Brigade, continued to dismiss the allegations on social media and some other allegations. The truth about her is related to a land dispute in Keo Phos commune, Stung Hav district, Preah Sihanouk province.
She confirmed that her land had a proper plan and was recognized by the authorities and officials, but a group of people came to build a shed on the land without permission and wanted to encroach. She also lodged a complaint with the relevant authorities about these abusive activities.
(Phnom Penh): Banks are an important source of capital for people to take loans to expand their business and improve their livelihood. Seeing this need, Hatta, a banking institution in Cambodia, has prepared a disbursement of 440 million US dollars to provide loans to customers in 2021.
Tycoon Huot Ieng Tong said that in 2021, the Cambodian economy could recover after a slowdown due to the spread of Kovid 19 more than a year ago. After the recovery, people will definitely need more capital to start or restore their business, so Hetha Bank has prepared a lot of capital to meet the needs of customers this year.
"Hatta Bank is ready to invest $ 440 million in loans to customers this year and plans to expand its portfolio by about 25 percent," he said. "2020 is the year of Kovid 19 disease. Hatta Bank will continue to promote lending to customers, which will increase Hatta Bank's loans by 25% compared to 2019."
He added that Hattha's savings accounted for an increase of 32%, higher than the increase in loans due to the fact that in 2020 there may be a crisis of 19 people did not invest or do business. Send to the bank to get interest, this is a surprise that Hatta received, because last year Hatta Bank did not receive much growth like this, and this is a growth and recognized as a growth during the crisis. Complex.
He added that the capital that Hatta Bank intends to serve the people is not a concern because Hatta has shareholders, a large bank in Thailand and a member of a large bank in Japan, so the capital planned to provide to customers is not. No shortage. As for other working capital through Hattha Bank's shareholder reputation operating around the world, it is not difficult to increase HATA Bank's working capital.
He added that Hattha Bank has prepared a lot of capital as well as developed many credit products to meet the needs of the people.
Mr. Oknha Huot Ieng Tong stated that in addition, Hatta Bank has a special offer for customers in case of disasters such as floods, droughts, etc. Hatta Bank always raises capital to promote and rescue customers, if any. This is due to the fact that Hatta Bank regularly advertises this special capital (credit products for society) to help these affected people.
This special loan is targeted by the shareholders and management of Hatta Bank, which is to participate in social development, so Hatta Bank has a program to participate in social development every year and has prepared some budget package.
