(Phnom Penh): Cambodia has become one of the three countries that export positive rice in 2020, in which fragrant rice ranks well in exports.
This event in the rice sector in 2020 seems to have changed significantly in Vietnam, a country known for producing white rice, which is shifting to fragrant rice production, and there is a shortage of enemy rice to buy rice from India and rush to buy rice from Cambodia.
The change in Vietnam's rice production has also affected and raised concerns for Cambodia, which requires Cambodian rice traders to pay more attention to maintaining the reputation of fragrant rice.
Following the shift to Vietnam's fragrant rice production, Cambodian rice leaders have called on rice traders to maintain their reputation and market for Cambodian fragrant rice as Cambodia enters a stage of competition with Vietnam. On the export of fragrant rice.
Song Saran, president of the Cambodian Rice Federation, told Fresh News that Vietnam is a white rice producer that competes with India and Pakistan, but Vietnam has recently turned to cultivating fragrant rice like Cambodia, leaving Vietnam short of rice. White will need to buy white rice from India. This is not surprising for Vietnam's transformation, as Vietnam usually needs to process fragrant rice and export at a higher price.
"This is a sign that Cambodia needs to carefully examine and follow Vietnam's next steps after this change," he said. In addition, Cambodia should do more research to make Cambodian fragrant rice stronger and able to lead both in quality and price in Vietnam.
He added, "Of course, Vietnam's change is also a concern for Cambodia, because Vietnam's fragrant rice exports cost between $ 550-600, but Cambodia's fragrant rice exports are not less than $ 700." That. "Cambodia's concern is that Vietnam can take advantage of the Cambodian market at this price."
He said that the special point of Cambodia over Vietnam is that the taste of Cambodian fragrant rice is delicious, good shape and high quality to store for a long time, but for Vietnamese fragrant rice, the taste can only last for one month. So in terms of taste, Cambodia ranks better than Vietnam, but in terms of price, Cambodia is higher than Vietnam.
Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng issues instructions to eliminate excessive noise caused by all types of vehicles
(Phnom Penh): Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Interior, has issued instructions on the elimination of excessive noise caused by all types of vehicles.
Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng also instructed the Capital, Province, Municipality, District and Khan Administrative Unity Command, which has the Capital, Provincial, Police, Municipal, District and Khan Police Inspectorates to inspect and educate the owners of vehicle processing sites to stop all non-technical vehicle processing. . In case of continued theft and processing, strict administrative and legal measures must be taken.
Separately, the relevant competent forces at all levels, especially the Capital and Provincial Police Committees, must take immediate action to instruct all competent forces under their supervision to inspect and eliminate all the use of vehicles to process cement pipes or remove cement pipes and to advise those in trouble. Vehicles cause noise to the people by:
* Pay attention to inspecting the streets of the town and stop the primary education to stop the activities as well as make the vehicle contract to install the cement pipe according to the correct technical specifications. At the same time, it is necessary to introduce morality and ethics in dealing with vehicle problems for car users with high volume in order to avoid harming the feelings and living rights of the general population and maintain social dignity.
Instruct the competent force to fulfill its duties and responsibilities strictly, thoroughly, with professional ethics and without exception. TOP NEWS: Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces to his compatriots to vaccinate Kovid 19, the first Chinese aid to build trust
(Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, on Sunday morning, January 17, 2021, announced to his compatriots that he will be the first to receive the vaccine with the help of Chinese friends in order to build trust in the vaccine and Promote the movement against Kovid 19.
Please be informed that on the night of January 15, 2021, Samdech Techo Hun Sen sent a special voice message to his compatriots, announcing that the Chinese government has provided 1 million doses of 19 measles vaccine to the Royal Government of Cambodia. Distributed to about 500,000 people.
Cambodian Prime Minister Samdech Techo Hun Sen has announced that the vaccination will be free of charge and on a voluntary basis.
Samdech Techo also stated that in addition to the 1 million doses of 19 vaccines against Chinese measles, Cambodia will continue to seek vaccinations for 10 million people, or up to 13 million, if there is a need to vaccinate up to 80 percent. Of that population.
In this audio message, Samdech Techo Hun Sen confirmed that he had originally announced that he would receive a vaccine recognized by the World Health Organization (WHO). But in the context of Cambodia being as widespread as it is now, it is no longer possible to wait, which is why Cambodia decided to use the Kovid 19 vaccine.
Not only for this reason, according to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the vaccine against Kovid 19 has already been used by Chinese government leaders, presidents and the people of Indonesia and millions of people around the world.
According to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, so far, not only the Chinese vaccine, but also other countries' vaccines do not know the validity or effectiveness yet. But Chinese leaders have been using the Chinese vaccine since October 2020.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen confirmed that the Chinese government's vaccine against Kovid 19 that Cambodia uses is Sinofam vaccine.
Samdech Techo stated that the reason for using the Sinofam vaccine is because it can be kept at a temperature of 2 to 8 degrees above zero, easy to store, compared with the vaccine in some countries require to keep at a temperature of 70 degrees below zero. In addition, the use of Chinese vaccines is easy to transport. Always wear a helmet while driving! 5 killed and 10 injured in traffic accidents nationwide on January 16 yesterday
