(Phnom Penh): Dr. Hang Chuon Naron, Minister of Education, Youth and Sports, stated that improving the qualifications of teachers is really important because teachers have the ability, both knowledge and skills to be able to provide a quality education that Can enable students to study, graduate, and get a job in accordance with their abilities and knowledge.
Dr. Hang Chuon Naron stated this morning, January 16, 2021, on the occasion of the opening ceremony of the program to improve the qualifications of school management and teachers of the Royal University of Phnom Penh, with the participation of Mr. Kien Tak Salak. The Deputy Rector, Dr. Chet Chea Lysal, Rector of the Royal University of Phnom Penh, and nearly 700 teachers from all capitals and provinces.
Dr. Hang Chuon Naron added that in the 6th legislature of the National Assembly, the Royal Government of Cambodia has considered the development of human resources as the first priority to achieve this priority area. One of the other important components to achieve the first rectangle of the fourth phase of the rectangular strategy.
The Minister added that the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports will turn all schools into green schools, schools that not only teach theory, but schools that bring students to different jobs in connection with what they Learned in the classroom through income and agricultural skills programs and other essential skills that also serve the national economy.
After failing to enter Cambodia on January 4, 2021 due to the lack of flights and measures to prevent Kovid 19, Ms. Mu Sochua and some former CNRP leaders asserted that they Will return to Cambodia again on January 17, 2021.
Words and actions Ms. Mu Sochua Hak expressed her strong belief in returning to Cambodia on January 17, 2021, despite the obstacles or obstacles. The words and actions of Mu Sochua and other former CNRP leaders have given a handful of supporters a strong and hopeful return of their beloved politicians.
As mentioned, on January 15, Mu Sochua began flying from one state to another in the United States. On the night of January 15 in the United States, the morning of January 16 in Cambodia, Mu Sochua and other former lawmakers arrived at Los Angeles International Airport to leave the United States. Singapore and change flights to Cambodia.
Arriving at Los An Airport, Mu Sochua's hypocrisy and shame were revealed. In fact, Mu Sochua only bought a plane ticket but did not have a visa to enter the destination country, so she could not be allowed to board the plane.
At this point, I would like to emphasize to readers that to travel to a country that is not our home country. Travelers must purchase a plane ticket and apply for a visa, commonly known as a visa (VISA).
In Mu Sochua's case, if she came to Cambodia with a Cambodian passport, she would not have to apply for a visa. But because his passport was revoked by the Royal Government, he could not use it to enter Cambodia.
Because Mu Sochua is an American citizen, Mu Sochua used her US passport to return to Cambodia. If Mu Sochua uses an American passport, then entering Cambodia requires a visa to enter Cambodia. Without a visa from the Cambodian Embassy in the United States, Mu Sochua would not have been allowed to fly to Cambodia.
Mu Sochua, who uses countless flights, clearly understands this procedure. But why is Mu Sochua still trying to make a clear statement about her position on returning to Cambodia, knowing that she could not?
In fact, Mu Sochua knew very well that she could not enter the country. But in order to wash away the shame and save the masses, including her supporters, for failing to come to Cambodia on January 4, Mu Sochua tried to perform a drama for the public and her fans to see. Really intended to come to Cambodia did not say a deceptive word.
Former CNRP supporters seem to have high hopes for the commitment of those they respect, despite repeated setbacks. They hope that leaders who strive to give trust and confidence will not deceive their hearts again.
Praise be to the skill of the cheater! "Cheating still cheats once a month, cheats twice." The return of Mu Sochua and her allies to the country is now a clear demonstration of their hypocrisy and lack of courage, or politicians, but words. General Knowledge: Babylon the Great, the Wonder of Love
