The grant agreement was signed on the afternoon of January 15, 2021 between Mr. Mikami Masahiro, Ambassador Extraordinary and Plenipotentiary of Japan to Cambodia, and Mr. Thailo, President of the Cambodian Water Association, and Mr. Cheng Limhan, Director of the Department. Preah Vihear Youth and Sports Education held at the Embassy of Japan in Cambodia.
