According to the special audio message of Samdech Techo on the night of January 15, 2021, Samdech Techo confirmed that the first people to be vaccinated against Kovid 19 are: those around the King, Samdech Techo, President of the Senate, President The National Assembly, as well as doctors, teachers, the armed forces of all kinds, the judiciary, all departments, all the sanitation personnel involved in the provision of services for motorbike taxi drivers, tricycles and taxis.
It should be noted that on the night of January 15, 2021, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, announced that the Chinese government has provided 1 million doses of Kovid 19 vaccine to the Royal Government of Cambodia to inject about 500,000 people. .
Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated, "We can not wait any longer. The need for national defense to protect the people from this devastating epidemic is to use the vaccines that have already been used for the leaders. "China, used by millions of people, and a number of other countries, including Indonesia, where the Indonesian president was first vaccinated, is a vaccine of the People's Republic of China."
Samdech Techo added, "We can not wait any longer because of the need to protect the health of our people, which today has up to 15 cases." Today, there are up to 10 more cases, all from neighboring Thailand. "So we need to use this vaccine for protection."
Samdech Techo stated, "I believe that this vaccine will facilitate us to solve some problems. Although we do not yet know the exact effect. Not just Chinese vaccines, but vaccines in every country do not yet know how many months or years or how long they last. "However, I, Your Majesty, know that the Chinese leader has been stabbed since October."
"So far, Foreign Minister Wang Yi of the People's Republic of China is very healthy and can walk almost everywhere," he added. Now visiting our Southeast Asia as well after visiting Africa. "Therefore, the experience of Foreign Minister Wang Yi, one of China's key leaders, gives us confidence that there is no risk to human life for Chinese vaccines."
Samdech Techo stated that the reason for using the Sinofam vaccine is because it can be kept at a temperature of 2 to 8 degrees above zero, easy to store, compared with the vaccine in some countries require to keep at a temperature of 70 degrees below zero. In addition, the use of Chinese vaccines is easy to transport.
