Police find 5 kg more drugs from Lao people who cracked down in Stung Treng province, a total of 46 kg of drugs confiscated
(Stung Treng): An additional 5 kilograms of drugs were found after the arrest of two Laotians in Stung Treng province, a total of 46 kilograms of drugs were confiscated during the operation.
It should be informed that the “A9” Special Forces of the Anti-Drug Department, with the participation of the Stung Treng Provincial Police Force, cracked down on illegal cross-border drug trafficking cases along the Cambodia-Laos border in O'Svay Commune, Borey District. O Svay Sen Chey.
As a result, the force arrested 2 suspects: 1: Akat, 29 years old, Lao national, and 2: Tun Keo, 28 years old, Lao national, and immediately found 41 pieces of drugs equal to 41 kg. On the morning of January 15, 2021, after receiving the confession, the specialized force brought the two suspects to get 5 more drugs equal to 5 kg that they hid.
Currently, the law enforcement officers of the Anti-Drug Office are preparing to send the suspects and exhibits to the Provincial Prosecutor's Office and find other relevant subjects to deal with the procedure.
Samdech Pichey Sena Tea Banh sends condolences on the passing of His Majesty King Norodom Yuvnath
(Phnom Penh): Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of National Defense, on January 15, 2021, sent a message of condolences on the passing of His Majesty King Norodom Yuvneath.
The condolence message received by Fresh News reads as follows: "At this time, my wife and I are extremely emotional to receive the news that His Majesty King Norodom Yuvneath, Personal Adviser to the King of the Kingdom Cambodia passed away on Thursday, January 14, 2021 in the United States at the age of 78 due to illness.
On this sad occasion, my wife and I would like to share our condolences with the concubines, including their sons and daughters, who are immortal, sad, miserable, and almost doomed, because the loss of King Norodom Yuvneath is the loss of God. The husband is social and the loss of the father is deeply religious, especially the loss of his royal family, patriotism, religion, one of the best kings.
At the same time, my wife and I would like to dedicate our prayers to the soul of His Majesty King Norodom Yuvneath, the Supreme Personal Adviser of the King of the Kingdom of Cambodia.
