(Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and President of the Cambodian People's Party (CPP) on January 15, 2021, sent a congratulatory message to Mr. Thongloun Sisoulit, Prime Minister of Laos, who was elected General. Secretary of the Central Committee of the Lao People's Revolutionary Party at the 11th National Assembly of the Central Committee of the Lao People's Revolutionary Party recently.
"I am pleased to announce that His Excellency has been elected Secretary-General of the Central Committee of the Lao People's Revolutionary Party at the 11th National Assembly of the Central Committee of the CPP," he said. Lao Revolution. On behalf of the Central Committee of the Cambodian People's Party and on my own behalf, I would like to extend my warmest congratulations to His Excellency on this solemn occasion. "
Samdech Techo Hun Sen continued that the election of Mr. Thongloun Sisoulit to the top position is a clear testament to the strong confidence of the Lao People's Revolutionary Party and the Lao people in his ability and wise leadership in Lead national development so that the people of Laos can live happily in peace, stability and prosperity.
Samdech firmly believes that under the sincere leadership, long-term and broad vision of Mr. Thongloun Sisoulit, the Lao People's Revolutionary Party will gain more trust and support from the people and be more successful in its implementation. Policies and resolutions adopted by the 11th National Assembly.
He is also confident that the traditional friendship, solidarity and cooperation in all fields between the CPP and the Lao People's Revolutionary Party, as well as between our two peoples, will be strengthened in the long run.
Samdech wished Mr. Thongloun Sisoulit great success in his noble mission to ensure the happiness and well-being of the people of Laos.
