He said WWF and the Ministry of Environment have been further strengthened to continue their close cooperation in the cause of managing, restoring and protecting a wide range of natural resources and wildlife that are valuable for conservation. Global, as well as to continue to develop the livelihoods of local communities in the Sre Pok Wildlife Sanctuary and Phnom Prech Wildlife Sanctuary.
