Senior Minister Osman Hassan Continues to Donate to 300 Families in Stung Trang District, Kampong Cham Province
(Kampong Cham): On the morning of January 14, 2021, Senior Minister Osman Hassan, Chairman of the Muslim Movement Committee, paid a courtesy call on and distributed food packages to 300 poor families in Tuol Po village, Prek Kak commune, Stung Trang district, Kampong Cham province.
Speaking on this occasion, Senior Minister Osman Hassan reminded all people not to neglect the Kovid-19 infection because the disease has not yet disappeared.
Senior Minister Osman Hassan confirmed that, according to the announcement of the Ministry of Health this morning, Cambodia has 13 positive cases Kovid-19, all of which are from outside, including 8 Cambodian workers from Thailand and from abroad. 5 people.
